{u_1, u_2} f b l₁) (List.foldr.{u_1, u_2} f b l₂)","unsafe":false,"value":301,"source":{"code":"theorem Perm.foldr_eq {f : α → β → β} {l₁ l₂ : List α} [lcomm : LeftCommutative f] (p : l₁ ~ l₂) :\n    ∀ b, foldr f b l₁ = foldr f b l₂ := by\n  intro b\n  induction p using Perm.recOnSwap' generalizing b with\n  | nil => rfl\n  | cons _ _ r => simp [r b]\n  | swap' _ _ _ r => simp only [foldr_cons]; rw [lcomm.left_comm, r b]\n  | trans _ _ r₁ r₂ => exact Eq.trans (r₁ b) (r₂ b)","start":174,"end":181},"axioms":["propext"]}